==German==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|de|hacken|Fleisch|lit=hacked meat}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈhakˌflaɪ̯ʃ/}}
* {{audio|de|De-Hackfleisch.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n,(e)s.sg}}

# [[mince]]d [[meat]]
#: {{ux|de|Frikadellen sind aus '''Hackfleisch'''.|Meatballs are made from '''minced meat'''.}}
# {{lb|de|figurative|informal}} the [[victim]] of a [[beating]] or a harsh [[reprehension]]
#: {{ux|de|Aus dem mach ich '''Hackfleisch'''!|I'll make him into minced meat!}}
#: {{ux|de|Wenn der Direktor das mitkriegt, bist du '''Hackfleisch'''.|If the principal finds out about that, you'll be minced meat.}}

